      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تعوّف</span></b>  <i>He</i> (a lion) <i>sought,</i> or <i>sought for</i> or
<i>after, the prey,</i> by night. (TA.) [It is used as
intrans. and as trans.:] see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَوْفٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُوَافَةٌ</span>.

